This repository contains experiment code derived from the ManiSkill PPO
baselines and extended for the StackCube visual PPO ablation project.

Upstream project: https://github.com/haosulab/ManiSkill
Reference commit: 42b68244c1497cef889b04c4f4a78aa01c927f4e
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0

The experiment-specific modifications include observation information
boundaries, asymmetric Actor-Critic networks, camera-specific encoders,
frame stacking, running normalization, auxiliary state prediction, Beta
policies, temporal CAPS, Actor-DrAC, gSDE diagnostics, NoEarlyReset training,
evaluation instrumentation, and regression tests.
